#: simplemonitor/qml/contents/ui/desktop/Settings.qml:236
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Windows does not offer CPU temperatures by itself. Start "
"LibreHardwareMonitor (free, open source) as administrator and keep it "
"running in the background – Simple Monitor then shows its temperatures "
"automatically. NVIDIA graphics cards work without it."
msgstr ""
"Windows stellt CPU-Temperaturen nicht selbst bereit. Starte "
"LibreHardwareMonitor (kostenlos, Open Source) als Administrator und lass es "
"im Hintergrund laufen – Simple Monitor zeigt die Temperaturen dann "
"automatisch an. NVIDIA-Grafikkarten funktionieren auch ohne."

